                    "sense_definition": "A bullfinch, a type of small bird.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "bird_archaic",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The old nature guide referred to the red-breasted bird as a <w>nope</w>.",
